description = "Emulator for the VTech V.Flash, also sold as the V.Smile Pro: a 2006 educational console built on an LSI ZEVIO 1020 (ARM926EJ-S) that plays CD-ROMs. The first emulator for the system, and early: it runs the real boot ROM to the system menu, but does not read discs yet, and save states are not implemented."
